# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3
## New: Facts and jokes about anything
- *"Fun fact about axolotls"*, *"trivia about the ender dragon"* or *"something interesting about copper"*: Merl tells you a fact about exactly that
- Over 170 new fun facts about mobs, blocks, items, enchantments, structures, biomes and Minecraft's history, over 800 in total
- *"Tell me a joke about Katter"*, *"make fun of Katter"*, *"roast me"* or *"joke about yourself"*: a friendly little tease, always lighthearted and never mean, from almost 500 jokes about people
- *"Tell me a joke about creepers"* picks a joke that's actually about creepers
- *"Another one"* stays on the same topic

## Block palettes
- More ways to ask: *"can you give me a palette including prismarine?"*, *"color scheme for deepslate"*, *"block combo with copper"*, *"I'm building with dark oak, what else should I use?"*, *"any good palettes?"* and many more
- Typos are fine: *"palett"*, *"pallete"*, *"prismarin"*, *"deepslat bricks"*
- *"Shuffle"*, *"try again"* or *"another"* right after a palette gives a new one
- *"A palette with prismarine and sea lanterns"* uses the first block it knows
- Questions that only sound like palettes (*"what blocks go with the castle?"*) get a normal answer
